4. Key Calculation Formulas

1. Total Monthly Verified Income = Sum(Borrower 1..3) + Sum(Co-Borrower 1..3) + Other Income
2. Housing Expense (Front)       = 1st P&I + 2nd P&I + Hazard + Taxes + MI + HOA + Lease + Other
3. Total Obligations (Back)      = Housing Expense + Neg Cash Flow + Other Debt Payments
4. Front DTI %                   = (Housing Expense / Total Monthly Income) * 100
5. Back DTI %                    = (Total Obligations / Total Monthly Income) * 100
6. Total Source of Funds         = SOF 1 + SOF 2 + SOF 3 + SOF 4 + SOF 5
7. Net Borrower Funds Paid       = Earnest Money + Required to Close + Cash Reserves + POC
